# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Android native shell (Capacitor)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPTIONAL. The production URL the Android APK's WebView loads is defined once,
# in capacitor.config.ts (`PRODUCTION_URL`). Set CAP_SERVER_URL only to point a
# local `npx cap sync android` at a different origin (e.g. a staging deploy).
# It must be an HTTPS URL and must not be a localhost/dev host.
#
# CAP_SERVER_URL="https://profolio-login-flow.vercel.app/"
